<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">HEBRU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hebrews</para>
  <para style="toc2">HEBRU</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="mt">HEBRU HAE</para>
  <para style="mt2">KALAN CCAKY</para>
  <para style="mt2">Hebrews</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Hebru hae kalan Ccaky</char> hynh doukunaw houh lung zah Khriccaaw zynnaw oun poutaw sei hae zya ci keiccuze kypaw nynh thua. Jesu Khri tuh byaccing te Pachia kya-e nyathya phykunawpaw nynh thua cipaw langsakunaw liate masaty e mih zynnaw kha ccawzeitu nynh thaw a pyanaw hae paw nynh thua. Tuhcite a honaw kya byaccing ccangthum a langsaku:</para>
  <para style="ip">(1) Jesu tuh zungzaete Pachia Ccapaw thua zah teingnaw kha a taeningnaw liate Paaw kaw a ngae ccaccingpaw nynh thua. Jesu tuh Pachia Ccapaw athua thyhawte Byakin Ryn kya-e profeh hae, vaaw hae te Moses laeze mah ahang huapaw nynh thua. (2) Jesu tuh Byakin Ryn kya-e silawtu hae laeze mah zungzae silawtu lante Pachia nynh a phy vae. (3) Jesu liate zyntu tuh seinaw, rinaw te chinaw kyate khum athua; Jesu tuh Silawtu Lupi athua hawte khumnaw ccaccing a pyatu nynh thua; Hebru beiknaw phunglang te sarangpaw silawkunaw hae nynh khumnaw kha a muinsan muihsahnaw kyalya a la langsaku hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">Byaria 11 lungkhu Israel hae phungpaw kya-e minthaan hae paw zynnaw tousenaw kha lawte ccawzeitu nynh a ccawriatu hae kha mih zynnaw kya atyn nawlan hae a tuhou hae. Byaria 12 kya a ccawriatu hae kha athangnaw cia zynnaw kya tyn oh lah, pawcih runaw te vawsawnaw oun thua zemah Jesu kha do oh cite a tuhou hae. Tuanaw pyanaw te raeringnaw pyanaw te ccauh kha a thangsah.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw: Khri tuh Pachia phykunaw accingnaw — 1.1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">Vaaw hae laeze Khri hanghuanaw — 1.4—2.18</para>
  <para style="io1">Joshua te Moses laeze Khri hanghuanaw — 3.1—4.13</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri silawtu thuanaw hanghuanaw — 4.14—7.28</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri byakinnaw hanghuanaw — 8.1—9.22</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri silawnaw hanghuanaw — 9.23—10.39</para>
  <para style="io1">Zynnaw aleihpaw — 11.1—12.29</para>
  <para style="io1">Pachia lungrynaw — 13.1-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Athangnaw sawsang — 13.20-21</para>
  <para style="io1">Bya thangnaw — 13.22-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccapaw kyate Oun Hopya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Langmaw lyaze profeh hae kyate ah minpaaw hae kya aphuinphuin te avae patae bya a hopaw Pachia nynh, <verse number="2" style="v" />hynh-e nyathyakou ccyh kya tuh a Ccapaw kyate nynh aening kha bya oun hopya vae. Tuh-e Ccapaw tuh pawpaw balyn rhoccoutu lang khang zah, amaw liate vaaw te lae hynh mah a rae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e Ccapaw tuh Pachia phu-enaw awnawpaw te Pachia thuanaw muinsan langsakunawpaw nynh thua. Athungpaw a bya liate pawpaw balyn kha po a tynsah. Aening seinaw hae kha amaw ccaccei nynh he oun thyaasahpah koute ahangnaw kya Lesaenaw ranglang khe a dahung vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Vaaw hae laeze Ccapaw Lesaehua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaaw hae laeze houh ahoy huaccepaw min kha a ccou keiccuze Ccapaw tuh vaaw hae laeze patae alesaehua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang tuh ka Ccapaw nynh na thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">atunin nang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">kae saahku vae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kae tuh a Paaw ka thua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aning tuh ka Ccapaw athua cih,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite thuasah vaaw hae kha Pachia nynh hummou a hopya boi?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sam 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Sa 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1Sh 17.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Te ccatawccaw kha laephi kalan he yn thuakhae te,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pachia vaaw hae balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha beik hae sah,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Deu 32.43</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pachia nynh vaaw hae konglang kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pachia nynh a vaaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khivae lang rae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a ryalahtu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">maeesoi lang a rae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Sam 104.4</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama Ccapaw konglang tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pou Pachia, na bawitungkhung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae te zungzae cia</para>
  <para style="q1">atynpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q2">Adingpaw ukkunaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na peenaw ukkunaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:6-7">Sam 45.6-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dingnaw kha na sungsah zah</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw kha na hua;</para>
  <para style="q1">Tukeiccuze pou Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">na Pachia nynh na ruiban hae laeze</para>
  <para style="q1">ae hangthung zah</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuanaw chitui ae thuh vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukoute, “Pou Bawipaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">athotakaw kya laephi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na bing, te vaawlang hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kuih te na raepaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Sam 102.25-27</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin tuh aroh cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">na tyn zungzae;</para>
  <para style="q2">boeining nynh apue hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e hae tuh apue cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />minmin kha boeining</para>
  <para style="q2">zung kheit hawte na bi cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh a rulaekuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Thuasalama nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">na rulaekuh khyh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na hiinnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">thang boi lan khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama, “Na rhaw hae kha na ccusy lang kae raepya makhia tuh, ka ranglang khe dahung,” cite vaaw hae kha hummou a hopya boi?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sam 110.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Minmin balyn tuh khumnaw rho a ccou vae cih hae paw kha ryalawpya khylan sawpaw ryalawpahtu muisaw hae thua khyh hae tou?</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Byathaetu hae Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aening nynh ah cciasei khyh nawlan oh, ah thae vae oh paw byaccing kha houh ah kyngku lan oh paw nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize vaaw hae kha mangte hopaw bya tuh tyn zah, cyiseimenaw miakaw te kawngae leinaw nynh atazaepaw detahnaw kha a mue hae lanze thuasah, <verse number="3" style="v" />myarya alepaw khumnaw kha aening nynh pawlang ah ria khyh oh ze thuasah pawcihtemou ah lue kho cih oh? Bawipaw nynh masaty lya mawte a hopaw hynh-e khumnaw tuh ahme cite amaw bya a thae hae paw nynh aening kya ccaekia a khan hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e ccaekiakhantu hae ryte Pachia nynh mah muihsahnaw hae, ngaeangnaw hae te khuaruarunaw aphuinphuin khate thuasah, amaw a rynaw thyhte Thyaa Muisaw nynh a pyapaw lasung hae khate thuasah ccaekia a khan.</para>
  <para style="s1">Vaaw hae laeze Anehua lante A Rae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aening nynh ah ho oh paw, yn thua vae cih paw laephi kha Pachia nynh vaaw hae kuihkaw kya nung khyh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Ccathyaa san kheit kyakhe lukheitpaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ccungccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">paw athua keiccu mou</para>
  <para style="q1">nang nynh na tua na lia?</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuhkhyhze, ccungccaw ccapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">paw athua keiccu mou na do-oih?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Sam 8.4-6</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaw kha vaaw hae laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">ccapyh anehua lante na rae;</para>
  <para style="q1">phu-enaw te sawtuanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na khungsakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />pawpaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccuphe kaw khe marya na nung,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite ccaekiakhan zah a ho. Pawpaw balyn kha amaw zakaw marya a nung cipaw tuh amaw zakaw a nung leipaw pawsang um khyh cinawpaw nynh thua. Thuasalama pawpaw balyn amaw zakaw marya a nungpaw kha atu aening nynh ah muih loh khyh oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia thawccinaw liate ccungccaw miakaw hanlan chinaw taangtua khylan, vaaw hae laeze ccapyh anehua lante rae athuapaw Jesu kha aening nynh ah muih oh. Chinaw a teing keiccuze aning tuh phu-enaw te sawtuanaw lukhung kha khungsah athua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn tuh amaw liate um zah amaw hanlan athuapaw Pachia nynh ccaaw hae patae kha phu-enaw kalan a cciakhaenaw kya, minmin khumnaw a thokhaetupaw kha a teingsahnaw liate accingpaw lang a tangsahpaw tuh angaekuhpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize a thyaasahtu te thyaasah athuapaw balyn tuh parouhte mih thonaw ccangkheit nynh thua. Tukeiccuze Jesu nynh minmin kha uno hae cite ko lan a maethyakhaekuh khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka uno hae kya na min kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka siakhae cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">a pumkuh hae paw ngaelung kya</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw thehoysahnaw hlaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka sah cih,” acikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Sam 22.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te, “Amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka doliakuh cih,”</para>
  <para style="q2">bua ci zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pachia nynh yn pyapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">imua hae te kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">hein kya kae um,”</para>
  <para style="q2">bua acikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17">Isa 8.17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 8:18">18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze imua hae tuh chii te saw kha a neethungkuh bua hae paw athua keiccuze, Khri amaw mah tuhawte chii te saw kha a neethungkuh bua; tuhcite Khri a chinaw liate chinaw tungvaw kawhoitu Satan kha rote, <verse number="15" style="v" />chi raw a ri hae keiccuze mih hiin lungkhu balyn seetangnaw kya um hae paw kha luesah khylan nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri nynh vaaw hae kha bawm khyh hae, Abraham ciihan kha nynh a bawm cipaw phe aria.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8-9">Isa 41.8-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae seinaw hanlan seishawnaw raepya khylan, Pachia te asekuhpaw uccaw hae kya Khri tuh thawccithyapaw te a lungzipaw Ranpibawi Lupi athua nawlan, pawpaw balyn kya a uno hae te a loku lan hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaw nynh tuhounaw kha a teing vae keiccuze tuhounaw a teing hae paw kha a bawm kho hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khri tuh Moses laeze Lesaehua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaawlang te asekuhpaw konaw kya a pabua hae paw athyaapaw uteno hae, aening nynh ccaekia ah khan oh paw Locceihtu te Ranpibawi Lupi athuapaw Jesu kong kha tuatua oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses tuh Pachia inn balyn kya a lungzi hawte, Jesu mah amaw a khangtupaw kya a lungzipaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Nam 12.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Inn saktupaw tuh inn laeze sawtuanaw a ccouhua hawte, Jesu tuh Moses laeze phu-enaw mue lan angaekuh huapaw nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize inn miakaw tuh ccungccaw lukhakheit nynh a sakpaw nynh thua, thuasalama pawpaw balyn a saktupaw tuh Pachia nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses tuh nyalang ho athua cih paw uccaw hae kha ccaekiakhan khylan Pachia inn balyn kya ryalahtu lu kheit hawte a lungzipaw nynh thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Khri tuh Pachia inn kya ccapaw hawte a lungzipaw nynh thua. Aening nynh zynkunaw thuasah, ngaehoinaw kya-e lungtuanaw thuasah athangnaw cia tynkaring lan ah kyngku oh ze, aening tuh amaw a inn nynh ah thua oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zyn leinaw Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Thyaa Muisaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Atunin amaw roi kha na thae oh ze,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Sam 95.7-11</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ramkaw kya syntaw nin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a dou lya hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lungkhung nan oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rya ka lawpaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae minpaaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">kum sung pali cia mang a muih hae pite</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn syntawtua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e ciihan kya ka thinria zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Mih thinlung tuh palei cceihsei zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka laanpi kha nyh khyh hae,’ ka ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka thinria zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Minmin tuh ka haeungnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">lungkhu lang tee lan khyh hae,’</para>
  <para style="q2">cite bya ka kinku,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Uteno hae, nanning nynh zyn leinaw thinlung ahoy leipaw kha hoite, a hiinpaw Pachia kyate na pou khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama “atunin” cite hopaw accyh a um lungkhu balyn tuh lu kheit te lu kheit nin takyhte thawzung la pyakuh oh. Tukhyhze tuh seinaw kya-e lingkunaw keiccu nae lungkhungsei cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize aening nynh atakaw e ah zynkunaw oh kha athangnaw cia tynkaring lan ah kyngku oh ze, aening tuh Khri a ruiban hae ah thua vae oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Atunin Pachia roi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na thae oh ze,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae minpaaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia a dou lya hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lungkhung nan sah,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Sam 95.7-8</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize mang a thae hae pite amaw a dou hae paw tuh hum hae mou? Moses nynh Izip ram kyate a cciakhae hae paw balyn kha thua khyh hae tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Nam 14.1-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama kum sung pali lungkhu Pachia tuh hum tungvaw mou a thinria? Ramkaw kya mih rhua a huekuh hae paw, a sei hae paw kya thua khyh tou? <verse number="18" style="v" />A haeungnaw lungkhu lang minmin tuh tee lan khyh hae cite Pachia nynh hum hae mou bya a kinnuaku hae? Kawngae lei hae paw kha thua khyh tou? <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze zyn leinaw keiccuze minmin tuh tee kho khyh hae cipaw ah muih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Byakinpyakupaw Haeungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia haeungnaw lungkhu lang teenawpaw byakinpyakupaw mang a um pite, nanning kyaze lukhakheit nynh tee leite a um khyh nawlan raeringkuh oh sih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize thehoypaw tuh minmin kalan mah hopya athua hawte, aening kalan hopya athua vae; thuasalama a thaetu hae nynh zynnaw te a lawku khyh hae keiccuze ho athuapaw bya tuh minmin hanlan thane khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize a zyn hae paw aening tuh tuh-e haeungnaw lungkhu lang ah tee oh. Laephi athonaw aleihpaw kyate Pachia a ryalaw hae tuh phe athang vae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka thinria zah, ‘Minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka haeungnaw lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q1">tee lan khyh hae,’ cite</para>
  <para style="q2">bya ka kinku,”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Sam 95.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa san kheit kya nin sarinaw nin kong kha hynhte a ho, “Pachia tuh nin sarinaw nin kya a ryalaw hae balyn kyate a haeung,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Gen 2.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e Ccathyaa kya, “Minmin tuh ka haeungnaw lungkhu lang tee lan khyh hae,” bua a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Sam 95.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, ccungccaw abang hanlan tuh-e haeungnaw lungkhu lang tee khonaw phang a um, masaty thehoypaw hopya athua hae paw minmin tuh kawngae leinaw keiccuze tee khyh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pachia nynh anin nin kheit kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Atunin” cite khya zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccyh khaw aro koute,</para>
  <para style="q1">langmawlya a la ho vae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Atunin Pachia roi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na thae oh ze, nae lungkhung nan sah,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite David kyate a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Sam 95.7-8</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize Joshua nynh minmin kha haeungnaw a la pya hae ze, tuh-e koute nin ccangpaw kong kha Pachia nynh la ho vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Deu 31.7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Jos 22.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia ccungccaw hae hanlan sabbath haeung nin tuh a um ung. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh a ryalaw hae kha thangsah zah a haeung hawte, Pachia kya-e haeungnaw lungkhu lang a teepaw ccungccaw tuh amaw a ryalaw hae kyate a haeung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Gen 2.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh kawngae leinaw keiccu a khuliaku hae hawte hum sanmah a khuliaku khyh nawlan, tuh-e haeungnaw lungkhu lang tee lan thawte zuakuh oh sih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia Bya tuh ahiinpaw, athungpaw te kyn ning te ahepaw thaloi laeze ahe huapaw thua zah, hiinnaw te muisaw, kintui te ru atungkunaw hae phianaw cia heize a thuing khopaw nynh thua; thinlung kya-e tuanaw te paccynkunaw kha mah aphiathyapaw nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pachia malang thuruh khopaw raepaw uccaw pawsang um khyh, pawpaw balyn tuh amaw malang khe akhawpaw um lei lante pong alangkuh; aening nynh ahmaw konglang kha amaw kya ah phykuh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaawlang po a khung vae paw, alesaepaw Ranpibawi Lupi, Pachia Ccapaw Jesu ah hoi oh keiccuze ah ccaekiakhannaw kha tynkaring lan kyngkuh oh sih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize aening ah Ranpibawi Lupi tuh aening thawzyanaw kya thawccihthya leipaw thua khyh, aning tuh aening hawte tuhounaw aphuinphuin a ing, thuasalama seinaw rae khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ahoboupaw ccyh kya bawmnaw mue nawlan, ngaethyaumsahnaw te thawccinaw kha ah mue nawlan oh, thawccinaw bawitungkhung kalan khe rawhoyte cceih oh sih.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ranpibawi Ryalaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae laku kyate popaw ranpibawi lupi miakaw tuh seinaw hae hanlan silawnaw te lasung hae kha Pachia kalan pya khylan, Pachia lante asekuhpaw uccaw hae kya ccungccaw hae ccelang khangpaw nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaw mah thawzyanaw aphuinphuin a hoipaw athua keiccuze aning tuh a nyhthya lei hae paw te a cceihsei hae paw tungvaw kya lungnenaw a hoi kho. <verse number="3" style="v" />Hynh-e keiccuze ccungccaw hae seinaw hanlan te amaw seinaw hanlan aning nynh silawnaw a rae aho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lev 9.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Hynh-e sawtuanaw hynh hum nynh sanmah amaw hanlan lawkuh kho khyh, Aaron a ko hawte Pachia nynh a kopaw ccungccaw rou nynh sawtuanaw kha a lawkuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Exo 28.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhawte Khri mah Ranpibawi Lupi thua khylan amaw te amaw kha phu-esakuh khyh, thuasalama,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang tuh ka Ccapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">atunin nang kha kae saah vae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a hotupaw nynh amaw kha a phu-esah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sam 2.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Ccathyaa ccangpaw kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang tuh Melkhizedek thuanaw thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae ranpibawi nynh na thua,”</para>
  <para style="q1">cite mah a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sam 110.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu tuh pynsaw lante a um lyaze, amaw kha chinaw kyate a khum khopaw kalan thawte sia zah mitphi luate, sawsang te a ngia; aning tuh Pachia raw a ri keiccu thaepya athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Pachia Ccapaw mang athua zemah, a teingpaw uccaw hae liate aning nynh kawngaenaw kha a ccangku. <verse number="9" style="v" />Accingpaw lang rae athua koute, amaw kaw a ngae hae paw balyn hanlan aning tuh zungzae khumnaw athotupaw lang yn tang. <verse number="10" style="v" />Melkhizedek thuanaw thyhte Ranpibawi Lupi lante Pachia nynh a ko vae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hyynaw te Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hynh-e konglang ho lanpaw patae kae hoi zemah na thaethya khyh oh keiccuze ccaesahpya lan aru. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh atu lya ccangpahtu lang heize tang lan vae paw, thuasalama Pachia bya athotakawnaw kha bua ccangpya na ho ung oh. Looh tangpaw thua leite samatei aho ungpaw nynh na thua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1Ko 3.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Samatei kyalya a neih ungpaw ccungccaw miakaw tuh imua athua ung keiccuze dingnaw bya kha nythyanaw hoi khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama looh tangpaw tuh piccan hae hanlan nynh thua; tuh-e hae tuh ahoypaw te athahpaw phiathya nawlan nynaw a hoi hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Piccan Thuanaw kalan Lethungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Khri konglang atakaw ccangpyakunaw hae kha cciataw te, piccan thuanaw ccangpyakunaw kalan khe cceih oh sih. Achihpaw ryalaw kyate ngaesikunaw kong, Pachia zynnaw kong, <verse number="2" style="v" />Baptisma kong ccangpyakunaw, kuih khangnaw kong, michi thoothuinaw kong te zungzae byapianaw kong ccangpyakunaw hynh aleihpaw te bua tho vae leite piccan thuanaw kalan cceih oh sih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pachia nynh oun ua ze, hynh-e hynh ah cyih cih oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize vaekheit awsah athua vae hae paw, vaawlang e lasung a taangtua vae hae paw, te Thyaa Muisaw a ccoubua vae hae paw, <verse number="5" style="v" />te Pachia bya ahoynaw te yn thua vae cih paw she kya-e thungnaw hae kha a taangtua vae hae paw, <verse number="6" style="v" />tuh-e hae nynh a khuliaku hae ze, Pachia Ccapaw kha mimaw hanlan bua a khiade hae paw thua zah raerae alangkuh lan maethyasah hae paw athua keiccuze minmin kha ngaesikunaw kalan bua kikhae lanpaw tuh thua kho khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize laephi nynh amaw vawlan palei leih accahpaw khuaatui kha neih zah tuh-e vawlan ryalahtupaw hanlan thingthae-eccang kha a pousahpya, te tuh-e laelung tuh Pachia kyate hythuanaw kha a ccou. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama hinpaw te thabu a pousahpaw laephi tuh thane vae khyh zah, thyalawnaw kalan a naekuh vae, tuh-e athangnaw tuh maee te soi lanpaw nynh thua vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-18">Gen 3.17-18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama sungsah hae paw, hynhcite nae kya kae ho zemah, nanning nynh khumnaw te azuikuhpaw uccaw, ahoy huapaw uccaw hae kha na cyih cih oh cite kae zynkuh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh nae ryalaw kha thuasah, mithyaa hae hanlan rya na lawpya vae oh paw te rya na lawpya ung oh paw kya amaw min hanlan na langsaku oh paw sungsahnaw kha thuasah kharouh ning lan ciate Pachia tuh a ding leipaw thua khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nanning lu raveih nynh na ngaehoinaw oh kha phe accing nawlan, tuhcihawpaw zuakunaw kha athangnaw cia na langsaku nawlan oh kou kae ry. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhteze nynh nanning tuh nae thawnaw leite, zynnaw te lungsaenaw liate byakinpyakunaw rho a ccou hae paw kha thydokuh hae paw na thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Byakinpyakunaw Atynpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh Abraham kha bya he a kinpakuh tuh, amaw lae ale huapaw min kha phyate byakinku lanpaw a um khyh keiccuze amaw te amaw kha byakinkuh zah, <verse number="14" style="v" />“Thanccingte nang kha hythua kae pya cih zah kae pungthungsah cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Gen 22.16-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Abraham nynh lungsaete a ngaesang keiccuze byakinpyakupaw kha a mue. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh tuh mimaw laeze ale huapaw min kha phyate bya leih a kinku hae; byakinkunaw nynh hopaw bya kha tynsah zah bya-eikunaw balyn kha a thangsah. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhte Pachia nynh bya a kinpyaku hae paw rho a ccoutu hae tungvaw kya arulaekuh kho leipaw a khuakhannaw kha ccaerarih lan langsaku a ry keiccuze a byakinnaw liate a tynsah. <verse number="18" style="v" />Khynnaw ah mue vae oh paw aening nynh tuh ah malang oun nungpyapaw ngaehoinaw kha kyngku khylan, alepaw thawzung pyanaw ah hoi kho nawlan oh, hynbya a ho kho leipaw Pachia nynh arulaekuh kho leipaw uccaw ccangning kya hynhte a cyi. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuh-e ngaehoinaw tuh phe ariapaw te atynpaw thinlung kya-e sivawhinpi hawte ah hoi oh zah, hminthyaa kya zokhawpaw boei lungkhu lang po a tee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Lev 16.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Melkhizedek thuanaw thyhte zungzae Ranpibawi Lupi athuapaw Jesu, aening hanlan Zeccuetupaw tuh tuh-e kalan phe a tee vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sam 110.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ranpibawi Melkhizedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Melkhizedek tuh Salem siapharan thua zah Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia kya-e ranpibawi nynh thua; aning nynh siapharan hae chianaw kyate yn kipaw Abraham kha cciadue zah hythua a pya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.1-2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Gen 14.17-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham nynh mah amaw kha luadepaw uccaw hae balyn kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha a pya. Masaty a min asuilan tuh, “dingnaw siapharan” nynh thua, tukoute Salem Siapharan mah athua, tuh-e tuh “daenaw siapharan” cipaw nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Aning tuh paaw hoi khyh, nung hoi khyh, thokeinaw hoi khyh, hiinnaw atho ccyh te athangnaw mah hoi khyh, Pachia Ccapaw hawte thua zah po atynpaw ranpibawi nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />E ccungccapaw tuh pawcih nynh alesae cipaw kha tuatua oh! Ciihan kyaze paaw athuapaw Abraham nynh heize amaw kha luadepaw uccaw hae kya-e pumhaw pumkheit a pya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ranpibawi thuanaw a hoi hae paw Levi ccaaw hae nynh mih uno hae athuapaw ccungccaw hae tuh Abraham ciihan athua hae zemah Kawbya thyhte minmin kyate pumhaw pumkheit kha lawkunaw kaw a hoi hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Nam 18.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama a thokeinaw kha Levi kyate suih athua leipaw Melkhizedek tuh Abraham kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha ccou zah, byakinpyakunaw a muepaw Abraham kha hythua a pya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Anyaa huapaw kha alesae huapaw nynh hythua a pya cipaw tuh eiku lanpaw um khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />E konglang kya, a chihthyapaw ccungccaw hae nynh pumhaw pumkheit kha a ccou hae; thuasalama khuhlang tuh a hiin cite ccaekiakhanpya athuapaw nynh pumhaw pumkheit kha a ccou. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pumhaw pumkheit a ccoupaw Levi nynh mah Abraham kyate pumhaw pumkheit a pyabua cite ho kho athua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize Melkhizedek nynh Abraham te a tungku lya kha Levi tuh a paaw pyn lungkhu nynh a um ung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae tuh Levi kyate a thopaw ranpibawi thuanaw kyate kawbya kha a mue hae, minmin nynh Levi kyate a thopaw ranpibawi thuanaw liate accingpaw lang a tang kho hae ze, Aaron thuanaw thyhte thua leite, Melkhizedek thuanaw thyhte ccangpaw ranpibawi yn pou lanpaw tuh pawmou aho ung? <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize ranpibawi thuanaw tuh rulae athua keiccuze kawbya mah rulae aho vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize e uccaw hae nynh a honuathepaw ccungccaw tuh ccangpaw phin nynh thua. Tuh-e phin kyate hum nynh sanmah silawhang kya ryalawpah boi khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize ah Bawipaw tuh Judah phin kyate nynh yn langku cipaw tuh phe aria. Tuh-e phin tuh ranpibawi thuanaw te asekuh cipaw Moses nynh kharouh ho khyh.</para>
  <para style="s">Melkhizedek tahawpaw Ranpibawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Melkhizedek tahawpaw ccangpaw ranpibawi alangku lanze, tuh-e tuh houh ariapaw nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e paw tuh pynsaw lante kawbya thyhte ranpibawi thua khyh, athang kho leipaw hiinnaw kya-e thungnaw thyhte nynh athua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang tuh Melkhizedek thuanaw thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae ranpibawi nynh na thua,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite ccaekia a khan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sam 110.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize voihaw lante, langmaw e kawbya tuh a thawzya zah ccungkia khyh keiccuze vua athua, <verse number="19" style="v" />pawccecize kawbya nynh pawsang ccingsah khyh; voihaw lante, ahoy huapaw ngaehoinaw kha thuakhae athua, tuh-e ngaehoinaw liate aening tuh Pachia kalan ah naekuh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Byakinkunaw um leite aning tuh ranpibawi lang tangsah thua khyh; pawccecize ming hae tuh byakinkunaw um leite ranpibawi lang oun tang hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Bawipaw nynh, ‘Nang hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Melkhizedek tahawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae ranpibawi nynh na thua,’</para>
  <para style="m">cite byakinkuh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopya keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">a tuanaw paleihkuh vae lan khyh,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a hopahtupaw liate ranpibawi lang yn tangpaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sam 110.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh-e byakinkunaw liate Jesu tuh ahoy huapaw byakinnaw kya-e aamahkhan lang yn tang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae tuh a chi hae keiccuze tuh-e ryalaw kya po tyn kho vae khyh hae zah milu lante patae a cih hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu tuh zungzae atyn keiccuze arulaekuh kho leipaw ranpibawi thuanaw kha a hoi. <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaw liate Pachia kalan oun cceih hae paw kha aning nynh zungzae a khum kho hae, pawccecize aning tuh minmin hanlan ngiapyanaw rae khylan zungzae a hiin keiccu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawccecize athyaapaw, seibe lan accan leipaw, anungsikuh leipaw, misei hae kyate a phiakuhpaw, te vaawlang hae laeze ahanghua lan hangthung athuapaw tuh-e Ranpibawi Lupi tuh aening hanlan angaekuhpaw nynh thua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuh-e ranpibawi lupi hae hawte, masaty amaw seinaw hanlan, te ccungccaw hae seinaw hanlan nin takyh silawnaw rae ho vae khyh, pawccecize amaw a pyn a pyaku lyakhe zungzae hanlan vaekheit te phe a ccingsah vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lev 9.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Pawccecize kawbya nynh thawzyanaw a hoipaw ccungccaw hae kha ranpibawi lang a khang hae. Thuasalama kawbya koute yn thuapaw byakinnaw kya-e bya nynh zungzae accingpaw Ccapaw kha a khang.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hopiatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atu ah ho oh paw uccaw hae kong abyapi tuh: Vaawram kya Lesaenaw bawitungkhung ranglang a dahungpaw, khahcihawpaw Ranpibawi Lupi kha aening ah hoi oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sam 110.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning tuh ccungccaw nynh sak leipaw, Bawipaw nynh a sakpaw beikbu ccaccing athuapaw beikinnthyaa kya Pachia ryalahtu nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize ranpibawi lupi miakaw tuh lasung hae te silawnawpaw khate silawpya khylan khangpaw nynh thua. Tukeiccuze hynh-e paw mah silaw nawlan ccangkhakheit a hoi aho. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize aning tuh laephi vawlan a la um lanze, ranpibawi la thua lan khyh, pawccecize kawbya thyhte lasung te silawpahpaw ranpibawi hae a um. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin tuh vaawlang e beikinnthyaa pungsan te alokuhpaw mynlyh kyakhe nynh rya a law hae. Tuh-e keiccu Moses nynh beikbu kha sak lan vae cite he a noukuh tuh, “Mua vawlan nang na kya langsahpya athuapaw pungsan thyhawte pawpaw balyn kha na rae nawlan raeringkuh,” cite Pachia nynh Moses kha raeringnaw a pya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Exo 25.40</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu tuh ahoy huapaw byakinpyakunaw kya thadynsah thua zah ahoy huapaw byakinnaw kya-e hopiatu mah athua keiccuze atu aning tuh ahoy huaccepaw ryalaw kha phe a mue vae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize masaty e byakinnaw tuh seimenaw a la um khyh lanze, vaeningnaw byakinnaw kha ccung la thua vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw hae kya Pachia nynh seimenaw muihpah hae zah a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Israel phin te Judah phin hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">byakinnaw thawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kae rae ccyh tuh solei yn thua cih;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.8-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31.31-34</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izip ram kyate minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kuih te ka sue hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ka cciakhae lya hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih minpaaw hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q1">ka raepaw byakinnaw thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">thua vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ka byakinnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh atyn khyh hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">kae mah minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka do-oih khyh hae cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e nin hae koute</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel phin kya ka rae lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">byakinnaw tuh hynhte nynh athua:</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka kawbya hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lungkhu kya ka nung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thinlung kya ka zei cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">te kae tuh mih Pachia</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thua cih zah, minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw hae athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha nytua,’</para>
  <para style="q2">cite lu kheit te lu kheit</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangpyakute hopakuh</para>
  <para style="q2">vae lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize adih huaccepaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ale huaccepaw kyacia</para>
  <para style="q1">mih balynte kae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn nyh vae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize mih hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya ka umsah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih seinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka liathui vae lan khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Byakin Thawpaw” a cipaw kya masaty byakinnaw kha arynpaw lang a tangsah vae. Ryn zah apuepaw uccaw tuh aro mawze azo cih.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Vaaw te Lae kya-e Beikinnthyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Masaty byakinnaw nynh heize Pachia beiknaw phung hae te laephi vaw e beikinnthyaa kha a hoi. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize beikbu kha sak hae zah, masaty khaan kya maeekhuatung, ccaboi te Nungpyapaw sanlou a um hae; tuh-e khaan tuh Hmin Thyaa a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Exo 25.23-30</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">31-40</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">26.1-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccangningnaw zokhawpaw boei nulang khe Athyaa Huaccepaw Hmin a ci hae paw khaan a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Exo 26.31-33</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e khaan kya mynkhuhpaw unawpaw sui silawhang te sui te po lekuh lan alaeekuhpaw byakin thingkua a um, tuh-e lungkhu kyatuin manna nungnawpaw sui ang, anaw toihpaw Aaron hoitang te byakin lungphe hae a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">Exo 30.1-6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">25.10-16</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 16:33">16.33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:8-10">Nam 17.8-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:16">Exo 25.16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Deu 10.3-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e byakin thingkua vawlan phu-enaw kya-e cherub hae nynh ngaethyaumsahnaw tungkhung kha phang a dawkhaw hae, tuh-e kong tuh atu phe ccing lan ah ho kho loh khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Exo 25.18-22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e uccaw hae tuh tuhcite paccyn he athua te, ranpibawi hae nynh mih rya kha law khylan, beikbu masaty akhaan lungkhu langkhe leih a tee hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Nam 18.2-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama ccangningnaw akhaan lungkhu lang tuh ranpibawi lupi rou nynh chii ryte kum kheit ze vaekheit kyalya a tee. Amaw hanlan te ccungccaw hae nynh nyku leite a rae hae paw seinaw hanlan tuh-e chii te aning nynh si a law.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Lev 16.2-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccangkheitnaw beikbu phang a thadyn lya tuh beikinnthyaa lungkhu lang ccianaw tuh hungpya thua loh khyh cipaw kha hynhcite Thyaa Muisaw nynh a muihsah. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuh-e beikbu tuh atu ccyh hanlan muihsahnawpaw nynh thua; tuh-e beikbu kya Pachia pyapaw te silawkunaw hae paw kha pya hae zah, tuh-e nynh a beiktu hae mawtemaw nykunaw thinlung kha ccingsah kho khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh aepaw, niapaw, singkupaw aphuinphuin te pynsaw te asekuhpaw phunglang hae kyalya thua zah raethuinaw ccyh kyacia rou nynh mang athua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama Khri tuh phe alangkuh vae paw ahoypaw uccaw hae kya-e ranpibawi lupi lante yn thua zah, kuih te rae leipaw, tuh-e ho rypaw tuh kuih te rae athua leipaw, hynh-e raenaw kya-e athua leipaw, lesaehua zah houh accingpaw beikbu liate, <verse number="12" style="v" />miaa hae te vaetuataw hae chii liate thua vae leite, amaw a chii liate Hmin Thyaa lungkhu lang vaekheit kyalya teete, aening hanlan zungzae shawkhawnaw kha oun raepya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize tangnuapaw hae te miaa hae chii, te maee te upaw vaetua tohlaw buhhaw hae khate a thyaa lei hae paw kha theipaw nynh pynsaw ccikanku nawlan a thyaasah kho lanze,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:15-16">Lev 16.15-16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:9">Nam 19.9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />zungzae tynpaw Muisaw liate Pachia kya ccaenaw um leipaw, amaw te amaw a pyakuhpaw, Khri chii nynh a chihpaw ryalaw kyate a hiinpaw Pachia ryalawpya khylan naemaw nykunaw thinlung kha pawcihmou houh a thyaasah kho cih!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Khri tuh byakinnaw thawpaw kya-e hopiatu nynh thua, tuhteze nynh Pachia nynh a ko hae paw tuh bya a kinpyaku hae paw zungzae tynpaw rho uccaw kha a ccou kho cih hae, pawccecize masaty byakinnaw zakaw kya cyiseimenaw kha shawkhaw khylan Khri tuh chinaw a ing vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Rhohuinaw kong hynh ho lanze rhohuitu a chih koute rou nynh zui lanpaw athua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize rhohuitupaw a chih koute nynh rhohuinaw tuh cyi khonaw a hoi, rhohuitu phang a hiin lya tuh rhohuinaw nynh kharouh kaw hoi kho khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze masaty byakinnaw kha heize chii leite tynsah thua khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize Moses nynh kawbya ccauh kya-e kawbya miakaw kha ccungccaw hae balyn kalan a hopah kou hae te, tui pykuhpaw vaetuataw chii te miaa chii kha lah zah sekakungpaw tuuming te hyssop khate ccauh te ccungccaw hae balyn kha thei hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.19-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Exo 24.6-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />“Hynh-e tuh Pachia nynh nanning ae pya oh paw byakinnaw kya-e chii nynh thua,” a ci. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhawte beikbu te Pachia beiknaw kya mangpaw uccaw hae balyn kha mah chii te pong a thei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lev 8.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Kawbya thyhte pawpaw balyn chii liate vya thang lan thyaasah athua, chii luanaw um leite seingaethyanaw um khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Lev 17.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Khri Silawnaw nynh Sei Thyaasahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaawlang umpaw uccaw hae pungsan kha khahcihawpaw silawnaw hae te thyaasah lanpaw tuh ahoboupaw nynh thua; vaawlang te asekuhpaw uccaw hae tuh tuh-e hae laeze ahoy huapaw silawnaw te nynh thyaasah athua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawccecize thanccingpaw pungsan athuapaw, kuih te raepaw beikinnthyaa lungkhu lang Khri tuh tee khyh; atu aening ccelang Pachia muihnaw kya langku khylan, vaawram lang nynh a tee. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuhzemah ranpibawi lupi nynh amaw chii athua leipaw ryte Hmin Thyaa lungkhu lang kum takyh a tee hawte, Khri nynh amaw te amaw kha palei pyaku lan tee vae khyh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhte a la thua lanze, laephi athotakaw te aning tuh palei a la teing vae cih; amaw te amaw silawkunaw liate seinaw kha ccaring vua khylan atu she athangnaw kya vaekheit rou nynh a langku. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae hanlan vaekheit chi lanpaw tuh laerui-awdepaw thua zah tuh-e koute byapianaw a um hawte, <verse number="28" style="v" />Khri nynh ccungccaw patae seinaw kha phu khylan vaekheit kyalya a pyaku. Amaw kha ngaehoite a ngawpaw ccungccaw hae kha khum khylan aning tuh seinaw te asekuh lei lante vaeningnaw bua yn langkuh ung cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Accingpaw Khri Silawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawccecize kawbya tuh yn thua cih paw ahoypaw uccaw hae mynlyh thua zah uccaw hae muinsan ccaccing thua khyh, kum takyhte pyapaw alokuhpaw silawnaw liate amaw kalan a naekuh hae paw kha kharouh ccingsah kho khyh hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />A ccingsah kho lanze, silawkunaw kha phe a la umtaw vae cih hae khaw? Pawccecize a beiktu hae tuh zungzae hanlan vaekheit te sei thyaasah athua hae ze, mih seinaw nykunaw thinlung hoi vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e silawnaw kya tuh seinaw bua liathuinaw kum takyhte a um. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize tangnuapaw hae te miaa hae chii nynh seinaw po lawpya lanpaw tuh thua kho khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze laephi kalan Khri yn thua lyaze aning nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Silawnaw te pyapaw uccaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na rypaw thua khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama kamaw hanlan pyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe nae paccynpya vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Sam 40.6-8</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maee-ute silawnaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">seithyaanaw silawnaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">na lungrythua khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuinte kae nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Ccauh kuekuhpaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw konglang azeiku thyhte,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou Pachia, na rynaw</para>
  <para style="q1">rae khylan nynh kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae thua,’ ka ci,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a ho. <verse number="8" style="v" />Luki langkhe, “Silawnawpaw hae te pyapaw uccaw hae, maee-ute silawnawpaw uccaw hae te seishawnaw silawnawpaw hae kha na ry khyh, tuh-e hae kya na lungrythua khyh,” (tuh-e hae tuh kawbya thyhte pyapaw nynh thua) cite a ho koute, <verse number="9" style="v" />aning nynh, “Ngaetua, pou Pachia, kae tuh na rynaw rae khylan nynh kae thua,” a ci. Vaeningnaw e kha tynsah khylan vaekheitnaw e kha phe a vua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e rynaw liate, Jesu Khri pyn kha zungzae hanlan vaekheit kyalya pyanaw liate aening tuh thyaasah ah thua vae oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ranpibawi miakaw tuh mih ryalaw kya nin takyh a thadyn hae, seinaw kharouh a thyaasah kho leipaw alokuhpaw silawnaw kha palei a rae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Exo 29.38</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama Khri tuh seinaw elang silawnaw ccangkheit kha zungzae hanlan a pya koute, Pachia ranglang khe a dahung vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sam 110.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh-e ccyh kyate a rhaw hae kha a ccusy lang rae athua makhia phang a ngaw vae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize pyapaw uccaw ccangkheit liate thyaasah athua hae paw kha zungzae accingpaw lang a rae hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thyaa Muisaw mah aening kya ccaekia nynh thua; pawccecize,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuh-e nin hae koute</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin ryte ka rae lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">byakinnaw tuh hynhte nynh thua:</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka kawbya hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">mih thinlung kya ka nung cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e hae tuh mih lungkhu kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ka zei cih,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite Bawipaw nynh a ho koute,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Jer 31.33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mih seinaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">kawbya pawlangria leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">mih cyisahnaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka liathui vae lan khyh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Jer 31.34</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Atu hynh-e seingaethyanaw a umnaw kya, seinaw hanlan pyapaw uccaw ho vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia kalan Naekuh Oh Sih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze uteno hae, Jesu chii liate beikinnthyaa lungkhu lang tee lan zynkunaw ah hoi vae oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e a chii liate aning nynh amaw pyn athuapaw zokhawpaw boei khate aening hanlan ahiinpaw laanpi thawpaw kha oun hungpya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pachia inn a uktupaw Ranpibawi Lupi ah hoi oh keiccuze, <verse number="22" style="v" />ahoy leipaw mawtemaw nykunaw thinlung kha thyaasaku khylan tui theikute, ah pyn kha tui ccipaw te singkute, thinlung ccaccing te zynnaw atynpaw te Pachia kalan naekuh oh sih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Lev 8.30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Eze 36.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngaehoinaw kong ccaekia ah khan oh paw kyate voikheit voikheit lang pu leite varyng kyngkuh oh sih, pawccecize bya oun kinpakuhpaw tuh a lungzipaw nynh thua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Sungsaku nawlan te ahoypaw rya kha law khylan lu kheit te lu kheit pawtemou lungthosaku lan cipaw kha tua kalang oh sih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ccungccaw abang nynh leih a cyimae hae hawte pynkheihlan pumkunaw kha umtaw leite, lu kheit te lu kheit thawzung pyakuh oh sih, Ninsaw tuh houhouh yn naekuh vae cipaw kha na muih oh hawte thawzung houhouh pyakuh oh sih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawccecize byaccing nynaw kha aening nynh phe ah mue kou oh te lungraroute ah sei oh ze, seinaw hanlan silawkunaw umlae vae khyh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama ri lan umpaw byapianaw yn thua lanpaw te rawsetu hae kha phe ccung lan a u cih hae paw, bungpawnaw maee rou nynh a um vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa 26.11</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses kawbya kha a zui leipaw ccungccaw tuh ccaekia lu ning khyhze lu thum nynh ccaekia a khan hae thyhte ngaethyaumsahnaw mue leite a chih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Deu 17.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Pachia Ccapaw kha a ccu kaw syde zah, amaw a thyaasahpaw byakinnaw chiise kha athyaa leipaw uccaw lang ria zah, thawccinaw Muisaw kha a saryapaw ccungccaw tuh pawcih alepaw detahnaw mou mue lan accan cite na tua oh?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Exo 24.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawccecize, “Liarunaw tuh kamaw kya-e nynh thua, kae nynh amee ka sangru cih,” cite Bawipaw nynh a ci. Te, “Bawipaw nynh a ccungccaw hae kha bya a pia cih hae,” bua a ci, cite a hotupaw kha aening nynh ah ny oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Deu 32.35</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:36">36</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahiinpaw Pachia kuih lungkhu lang ccaw lanpaw tuh ri lan umpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning kha awsah na thua kou oh te, alepaw vawsawnaw na teing oh zah na ngaesang oh paw, langmaw e nin hae kha bua liathuitua oh. <verse number="33" style="v" />Vaekhakheit vae ze ccungccaw hae malang saryanaw te vawsawnaw kha na teing oh zah, vaekhakheit vae ze tuhcite a teing hae paw ryte mungkute na teingkheih oh. <verse number="34" style="v" />Pawccecize thongccah hae paw kha thaw na cci oh, te ahoy huapaw te atynpaw uccaw na hoi oh paw kha na nyku oh keiccuze na hoi oh paw uccaw hae ae luade oh paw kha lungtuate na ngaesang oh. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tukeiccuze myarya lepaw lasung a thuakhaepaw nae rawhoynaw kha vua nan oh. <verse number="36" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia rynaw kha na rae kou oh te, byakinpyakupaw na mue nawlan oh ngaesangnaw na hoi oh aho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Pawccecize yn thua cih paw</para>
  <para style="q2">aning tuh thysung leite</para>
  <para style="q1">sosohtari aro koute</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thua vae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.37-38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:3-4">Hab 2.3-4</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Adingpaw ka ccungccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zynnaw liate a hiin cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama lukhakheit nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nulang a sihku lanze</para>
  <para style="q1">ka muisaw tuh tuh-e paw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungrythua lan khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Thuasalama aening tuh ronaw kalan nulang a sihkuh hae paw ah thua khyh oh, thuasalama zynnaw hoite khumnaw a ccou hae paw nynh ah thua oh.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zynnaw Asuilan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zynnaw tuh ngaehoipaw uccaw hae kha ka mue ccaccing cih cite phe riasakunaw te, muih loh leipaw uccaw hae kha a um ccaccing cite nynaw nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize tuh-e zynnaw liate langmawlya e ccungccaw hae tuh Pachia lungry a tung hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Laephi tuh Pachia bya liate rae athua cipaw kha zynnaw liate ah thaethya oh; muihpaw uccaw hae hynh muih leipaw uccaw hae kyate raepaw nynh thua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:1">Gen 1.1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Sam 33.6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Joh 1.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Abel, Enok te Noah kha Dosuinkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abel nynh zynnaw liate Kain silawnaw laeze ahoy huapaw silawnaw kha Pachia kalan a pya. Tuh-e zynnaw liate aning tuh miding lante ccou athua, pawccecize a lasung kha Pachia nynh a ccoupya; aning tuh a chi vae zemah tuh-e zynnaw liate bya a ho ung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Gen 4.3-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Enok tuh chinaw a tung vae khyh ccaw cite zynnaw liate lawthung athua. Pachia nynh amaw kha a lawthung vae keiccuze aning tuh muih lan um vae khyh. Pawccecize lawthung athua maw, “Aning tuh Pachia lungry a tung,” cipaw ccaekia kha a hoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Gen 5.21-24</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Zynnaw leite Pachia lungrytung lanpaw tuh thua kho khyh; pawccecize Pachia kalan yn naekuhpaw ccungccaw nynh tuh Pachia a um cipaw te amaw a ccung hae paw kha amee a pya hae cipaw kha a zyn hahe cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Noah tuh muih loh leipaw uccaw hae kong kha Pachia nynh raeringnaw a pya koute a innbyn khumnaw hanlan Pachia rawrinaw te zynnaw liate sanphalung kha a sak, tuh-e zynnaw liate laephi kha seibe zah zynnaw liate yn thuapaw dingnaw rho a ccoutu lang yn tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Gen 6.13-22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Abraham Zynnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham nynh rho lang a ccou cih paw ram langkhe ccia khylan ko he athua tuh, zynnaw liate kaw a ngae; teilang nynh ka ccia cipaw ny leite a cceih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Gen 12.1-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Byakinpyakupaw loram kyakhe ramccangpaw hawte zynnaw liate a um. Tuh-e byakinpyakunaw kha amaw ry, rhoccoutu athua hae paw Isak te Jakob ryte bu kya a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Gen 35.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh a sakpaw te a raepaw, atynpaw athonaw a hoipaw khuapi kha aning nynh a ngaehoi. <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham tuh myarya taw vae zah Sarah mah a tiinnung athua zemah zynnaw liate ccaawpoi khonaw thawzung a mue; pawccecize bya a kinpakuhtupaw tuh a lungzipaw nynh thua cipaw a zyn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Gen 18.11-14</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze achihpaw hawte athua vae paw Abraham kyate vaawlui e awsi hae zeih alungpaw te rili kin e riatae leipaw laesia zeih alungpaw ciihan patae a pui hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Gen 15.5</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22.17</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 32:12">32.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hynh-e ccungccaw hae balyn tuh byakinpyakupaw kha ccou leite zynnaw hoite a chih hae. Thuasalama minmin nynh asawpi te tuh-e tuh muihlang hae zah a cciadue hae, te minmin tuh laephi vawlan mikhia hae te khuaccong hae paw nynh kae thua cipaw ccaerarih lan a nyku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:4">Gen 23.4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1Sh 29.15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Sam 39.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize tuh-e uccaw kong a hotu hae nynh minmin tuh mimaw ram nynh a ccung hae cipaw ccaerarih lan a langsaku hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Minmin nynh a poutaw hae paw ram kha palei a la tuathui hae ze, tuh-e ram lang bua kithui lan ccyhhoypaw phe a hoi cih hae paw. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh ahoy huapaw ram kha a ngae hae, tuh-e ram tuh vaawram nynh thua. Tukeiccuze mih Pachia cite koku lanpaw kha Pachia tuh a maethah khyh; pawccecize Pachia nynh minmin hanlan khuapi kha a paccynpya vae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abraham tuh syntawtua athua lyakhe zynnaw liate Isak kha silawku nawlan a pya; byakinpyakupaw a muetupaw nynh a hoi thypaw a ccapaw kha a pya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Gen 22.1-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaw kong lante asekuhte, “Isak kya nynh na ciihan tuh atyn cih,” cite hopya athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Gen 21.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Pachia tuh achihpaw heize a thosathui kho cite varyng a zyn; aning nynh muihsahnaw lante a chih hae paw kyate Isak kha mah a mue. <verse number="20" style="v" />Isak nynh yn thua cih paw uccaw hae kong lante Jakob te Esau kha zynnaw liate hythua a pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Gen 27.27-29</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 27:39-40">39-40</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakob nynh a chi dyn khe Josef ccaaw hae kha zynnaw liate hythua ccarou a pya hae, te a hoitang dung kya phang ngeikute Pachia kha a beik.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:31">Gen 47.31</ref> (LXX), <ref loc="GEN 48:1-20">48.1-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Josef nynh a chi dyn khe, Israel ccaaw hae nynh a pou lan hae paw kong kha zynnaw liate hosya zah amaw a ru konglang te bya a tawsya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:24-25">Gen 50.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Exo 13.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Moses Zynnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moses he a pui tuh, apuithyapaw imua nynh thua cipaw kha a muih hae keiccuze zynnaw liate siapharan nynh kawthopaw kha ri leite a nung te a paaw nynh Moses kha sawpaw sah thum a thuruh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:22">Exo 1.22</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 2:2">2.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses nynh piccan he thua tuh, Faro ccanung a ccapaw cite koku lanpaw kha zynnaw liate phe a ei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Exo 2.10-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Seinaw te asekuhpaw lungrythuanaw kya sosoh hoysah lanpaw laeze Pachia ccungccaw hae ryte vawsawnaw teing lanpaw kha a poku paleih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Izip ram kya-e sisua hae laeze Khri keiccuze saryakunaw tuh asung huapaw hoirumnaw nynh thua cite a tuaku. Pawccecize nyalang mue lanpaw lasung kha nynh a tua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Siapharan thinrianaw kha ri leite Izip ram kha zynnaw liate a cciataw; pawccecize muih kho leipaw Pachia kha a muihpaw hawte aning nynh phang a ngaesang. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ccatawccaw hae a rohtupaw nynh Israel ccatawccaw hae kha a ty khyh nawlan, Moses nynh Kawtaw Poi te chii theinaw kha zynnaw liate a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Exo 12.21-30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ccangpaw Israel Rawhoytu hae Zynnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel hae nynh laerou kya ccia hawte zynnaw liate Rili Se kha po a zua hae. Tuhcite Izip hae nynh he a zuabua hae tuh tui nynh pong a vu hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Exo 14.21-31</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Jeriko khualungrua kha nin sari a voilu kou hae te, zynnaw liate khualungrua tuh pong atin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Jos 6.12-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v" />Ohhuanung Rahab tuh dophitu hae kha ahoyte innccong a thuasah hae keiccuze zynnaw liate aning tuh kawngae lei hae paw kya chihbua khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Jos 2.1-21</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 6:22-25">6.22-25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuhlaelan pawmou ka ho ung cih? Gideon, Barak, Samson, Jefthah, David, Samuel te profeh hae kong honaw ccyh ka zaw lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">Bpt 6.11—8.32</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">4.6—5.31</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16:31">13.2—16.31</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12:7">11.1—12.7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1-2:11">1Sa 16.1—1Si 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:1-25:1">1Sa 1.1—25.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuh-e hae nynh peenaw hae kha zynnaw liate a tae hae, dingnaw rya kha a law hae, byakinpyakunaw kha a mue hae, chindeih hae khalang kha a myhsah hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Dan 6.1-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v" />Maee aruapaw kha a the hae, thaloi haw kyate a lue hae, thawzyanaw kyate a thawsaepaw lang a tang hae, rhawdounaw kya a rawthungpaw lang a tang hae, ramccang rhawkaw hae kha a ccuesah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:1-30">Dan 3.1-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v" />Nopi hae nynh mih michi hae kha hiinnaw kalan thoosahthuinaw te bua a mue hae, te mingccang hae tuh ahoy huapaw thoothuinaw kha mue khylan luesahnaw kha lawku leite tuaasahnaw kha a teing hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1Si 17.17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:25-37">2Si 4.25-37</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v" />Abang tuh saryanaw te ziakunaw kha a teing hae, sivawrui te khii hae zah thongsaw hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:26-27">1Si 22.26-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25-26">2Sh 18.25-26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Jer 20.2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 37:15">37.15</ref>, <ref loc="JER 38:6">38.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v" />Lung te a deih hae, thing-aw te ccangning lang a aw hae, thaloi te a chia hae, tuu phua te miaa phua kha kikuh hae zah a khiakuh hae; boeining leite ae van ae leite vawsaw a teing hae, ming hae nynh a tuaa a sah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2Sh 24.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v" />Laephi tuh minmin te ngaekuh khyh. Minmin tuh ramkaw kya, mua hae kya a la khiakuh hae, lungkarung te laekarung hae kya a la um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Minmin balyn tuh zynnaw liate thehoynaw a ccou hae zemah byakinpyakupaw kha mue khyh hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Minmin tuh aening leite accingpaw lang rae athua khyh nawlan hae Pachia nynh ahoy huapaw uccaw kha aening hanlan oun paccynpya vae.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Dosuinku lanpaw Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aening mah ccaekia athuapaw maeking pi nynh phang oun koihlu keiccuze zoikadeih lan kaang oun kaesahpaw seinaw te phupaw miakaw kha ccanglang dae nung oh sih lah, aening malang a umpaw ccuetaekunaw kyakhe lungsaenaw te ccue oh sih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aening zynnaw a thotu te a ccingsahtupaw Jesu kha riri dote ccue oh sih. Aning tuh maethyanaw kha pawlangria leite amaw malang nungpya athuapaw lungtuanaw hanlan vaelantung kya teingnaw kha ngaesang zah Pachia kya-e bawitungkhung ranglang khe a dahung vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning nae lungthawthang khyh nawlan te nae lungthawzya khyh nawlan misei hae kya-e khahcihawpaw rawsenaw a ngaesangtupaw amaw kha la tuatua oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Nanning nynh seinaw dounaw kya chii phe lua lan ciate na dou loh khyh oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccaaw hae kya hopya hawte nanning hopyapaw hyynaw bya kha na ning vae oh tou? Tuh-e bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka ccapaw, Bawipaw thuiheinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlangria leite um nan,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw nynh ae thuihei ze</para>
  <para style="q2">na lungthang nan sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.5-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:17">Job 5.17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">Ptb 3.11-12</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a sungsahpaw kha a thuihei,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaaw lante a ccoupaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">de a tah,” acikuh.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuiheinaw kha na ngaesang oh ze, Pachia nynh ccaaw hae hawte ae ccuepe cih oh; pawccecize paaw nynh a thuihei leipaw ccaaw a um zawtou? <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw miakaw nynh a mue hae paw thuiheinaw kha na muebua khyh oh ze, ccaaw ccaccing na thua khyh oh, ccalah nynh na thua oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhlaeze aening oun thuiheipaw pynsaw lante paaw hae ah hoi oh zah, minmin kha saw ah tua oh; tuhlaeze muisaw lante ah Paaw kaw kha houh ngaete ah hiin lan khyh oh tou? <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize tuh-e paaw hae nynh ahoy cite a tua hae thyhte sosoh nynh oun thuihei hae; thuasalama Pachia nynh tuh amaw kya-e thyaararihnaw kha ah neethungku bua nawlan oh, aening thanenaw hanlan nynh oun thuihei. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuiheinaw miakaw teing lya tuh lungpawnaw laeze ngaethyanaw cite tua lan a umhua; thuasalama thuiheinaw te kia athua hae paw hanlan, tuh-e nynh nyalang tuh daenaw te asekuhpaw dingnaw thae kha a thuakhaepya hae.</para>
  <para style="s">Thuiheinaw te Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze balae tingpaw kuih hae te a thawzyapaw ccukharu hae kha thawsaesah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:3">Isa 35.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Ccukhoupaw ccu tuh poh khahku leite dansah athua nawlan, nae ccu hanlan laanpi kha lawsah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Ptb 4.26</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw te daenaw te um lanpaw te thyaararih lante um lanpaw kha zuakuh oh; thyaanaw leite hum nynh sanmah Bawipaw kha muih lan khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pachia thawccinaw kha hum nynh san mue leite a um khyh nawlan, akhahpaw tharui kyate yn popaw nynh nanning kha vawsaw ae pya khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh; tuh-e nynh ccungccaw patae kha a nungsisaku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Deu 29.18</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />A ohhuakuhpaw a um khyh nawlan, tuhkhyhze ccatawccaw thuanaw kha aepaw kaw kheit lang a zuakuhpaw Esau hawte Pachia pawlangria leipaw na thua khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Gen 25.29-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize Esau nynh nyalangte hythuanaw rho kha he a ccou ry tuh mue kho vae khyh, hythuanaw kha mitphi te thawte a ccung zemah a paaw kya-e ngaesikunaw kha mue kho vae khyh cipaw na ny oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Gen 27.30-40</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning nynh kuih te ty khopaw mua kalan na thua khyh oh, tuh-e mua kyatuin maee aruapaw, maeking amanpaw te mohnaw a um, khise tho zah<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.18-19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">Exo 19.16-22</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">20.18-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:11-12">Deu 4.11-12</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 5:22-27">5.22-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />mungkae roi te bya roi accae; tuh-e roi a thae hae paw nynh mih kalan bya bua a ho vae khyh nawlan a ngia hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize, “Sahiin nynh heize tuh-e mua tuh a ty ze, lung te deih athua cih,” cikuhpaw kawbya kha minmin nynh ngae ngan khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Exo 19.12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh-e muih tuh myarya ri lan um zah Moses nynh, “Myaryamaw ka rih zah ka thyngkuh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Deu 9.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh Zion mua lang, ahiinpaw Pachia khuapi athuapaw vaaw Jerusalem lang, riatae lei vaaw hae lungpawte a tungkunaw hae kalan, <verse number="23" style="v" />vaawlang kya min zei athuapaw ccatawccaw hae a pumkunaw hae kalan, ccungccaw balyn bya a piatupaw Pachia kalan, accingpaw lan rae athuapaw adingpaw ccungccaw hae muisaw hae kalan, <verse number="24" style="v" />byakinnaw thawpaw kya-e hopiatu Jesu kalan te Abel chiise nynh a hopaw uccaw laeze ahoy huapaw uccaw kong a hopaw theipaw chiise kalan na thua vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Gen 4.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nanning nynh a hotupaw bya kha na ei khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh; pawccecize laephi vawlan a hotupaw bya a ei hae paw tuh detahnaw kyate a lue khyh hae ze, vaawlang te a hotupaw bya kha aening nynh ah ei oh ze, pawtemou ah lue kho cih oh?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:22">Exo 20.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe amaw roi nynh laephi kha a hysah; thuasalama atu aning nynh, “Tuhzemah laephi kyalya thua leite, vaawlang kha mah vaekheit bua ka hy ung cih,” cite byakinkute a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2.6</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Hynh-e, “Tuhzemah vaekheit bua,” cipaw bya nynh a langsakupaw tuh hy kho a um leipaw uccaw hae tuh po a um cih zah, ahy khopaw uccaw hae athuapaw raepaw uccaw hae tuh nue athua cih cinawpaw nynh thua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ahy kho leipaw peenaw kha ah ccou oh keiccuze lungpawte um oh sih, sawtuanaw te rawrinaw ryte douccah lante Pachia kha beik oh sih. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawccecize aening ah Pachia tuh aruapaw maee nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Deu 4.24</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Lungtungpaw Rya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uteno sungsakunaw kha po tynsah oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mikhia hae do-oihnaw kha la ning nan oh. Pawccecize tuhte mikhia do-oihnaw kya abang nynh vaaw hae kha tualeipite innccong a la thuasah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Gen 18.1-8</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19.1-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Thongccah hae paw kha ning nan oh; minmin ryte thongccahkheih hae paw hawte tuakuh oh; vawsawnaw a teing hae paw kha la ning nan oh, naemaw nae pyn kya tuhcite a teingpaw hawte tuakuh oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn nynh zuvaw tangnaw hynh sawtua lanpaw nynh thua, te zuvaw tangnawpaw ikhung mah thusah lanpaw thua khyh; a ohhuakuh hae paw te milae zu milae vawpaw ryte a sei hae paw tuh Pachia nynh byapia cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nae hiinzia tuh phua a duaa leipaw thua sah lah, na hoi oh paw uccaw hae khate nae lungryachih sah. Pawccecize Pachia nynh, “Nang kha kae cciataw boi lan khyh zah kae vua boi lan khyh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Deu 31.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Jos 1.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Bawipaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae yn bawmtu thua zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rih lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Ccungccaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">pawmou yn cyih kho cih?”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite rawhoyte ah ho kho cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Sam 118.6</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nae kya Pachia bya ae la hopah oh paw, nanning ae la cciakhae oh paw kha la ning nan oh. Mih hiinzia nynh a poukhaepaw kha tua biate, mih zynnaw kha thydokuh oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu Khri tuh inkhawnin, atunin te zungzae cia rulaekuh khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Alokuh leipaw ccangpyakunaw aphuinphuin nynh ae cciakhaesei nan oh sah; pawccecize aepaw te thua leite, thawccinaw liate lungthawsaesahpaw tuh ahoypaw nynh thua. Aepaw kyalya phang a tua hae paw tuh thanenaw mue khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Beikhang ccangkheit ah hoi oh zah, tuh-e kya tuh beikbu ryalahtu hae nynh aenaw kaw hoi khyh hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize ranpibawi lupi nynh sahiin chii kha beikinnthyaa lungkhu lang teekhae zah seinaw hanlan silawnaw a rae vae ze, sahiin pyn hae kha ryabu atolang khe maee te a u hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Lev 16.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jesu mah amaw a chii te ccungccaw hae kha thyaasah khylan koikua atolang khe a teing. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aening nynh amaw kalan ryabu atolang cceih oh sih lah, a teingpaw saryanaw kha teingbua oh sih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize aening tuh hein kya po atynpaw khuapi ah hoi khyh oh, yn thua cih paw khuapi kha nynh ah ccung oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze amaw liate Pachia kalan thehoysahnawpaw silawkunaw kha palei rae oh sih, tuh-e tuh amaw min kya lungtuabya hopaw khalang athae nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahoypaw cyi lanpaw te neethungbua lanpaw kha la ning nan oh; pawccecize tuhcihawpaw silawnaw hae kya Pachia tuh a lungrythua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nanning ae uktu oh paw kaw kha ngae oh lah, mih bya kha zui oh. Pawccecize minmin tuh mih ryalaw kong a phykuh cih hae paw athua hawte, nanning kha ae do-oih oh. Ngaethyanaw te thua leite lungtuanaw te ryalah hae sah; pawccecize tuhte ngaethyanaw te rya a law hae paw tuh nae hanlan thanenaw um lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kaening hanlan saw oun sangpah oh; kaening tuh mawtemaw nykunaw thinlung athyaapaw kae hoi zah pawpaw kya balyn kou hoy lante hiin lan kae ry cipaw kha kae nyku ccaccing. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kae tuh nae kalan taloi bua kae thua nawlan, saw yn la sangpah oh cite pekite kae ngia oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Athangnaw Sawsang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zungzae atynpaw byakinnaw chiise liate, tuu hae kya-e alesaepaw Tuurintu, ah Bawipaw Jesu kha chinaw kyate a thoosahpaw, daenaw Pachia nynh, <verse number="21" style="v" />amaw malang a lungrythuapaw rya kha Jesu Khri liate nae kya lah zah a rynaw kha na rae kho nawlan oh, ahoypaw ryalaw miakaw kya nanning kha ae ccingsah vae oh sah. Jesu Khri kya zungzae te zungzae cia phu-enaw um sah. Amen.</para>
  <para style="s">Athangnaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uteno hae, hyynawpaw bya hynh la ngaesang oh cite kae ngia oh; pawccecize nae kalan ccaw hynh adynnaw te nynh ka zei. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ah unopaw Timote tuh a luesah vae hae cipaw la nyh oh. Aning tuh aro maw yn thua ze naemaw ryte kae muihkheih cih oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nanning ae cciakhaetu oh paw balyn te mithyaa hae balyn kha la beihlang oh. Italy ram kya a um hae paw nynh nanning kha ae beihlang oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Nae balyn tungvaw kya thawccinaw la um sah. Amen.</para>
</usx>